## Command

```shell
biome inspect plugins --config-path=packages/mobile --path=packages/mobile/src/file.ts
```

## `packages/mobile/biome.json`

```json
{
  "plugins": [
    "./base.grit",
    { "path": "./src-only.grit", "includes": ["src/**"] }
  ],
  "overrides": [{ "includes": ["src/**"], "plugins": ["./src-override.grit"] }]
}
```

